astro is great, by the way. you should give it a try.
anyway, this site is lightweight, fast, simple and I think it looks pretty good.


why am I writing this blog in english if I'm brazilian?
english, for better or for worse became the universal language used in planet earth,
so I'm killing two birds with one stone. I reach a wider audience and get to practice my second language more often

